        "parameters": {
          "content": "## Financial Research Agent - v1\nAnswers questions about the 2025-26 annual reports of TCS, Infosys and Wipro.\n\nFlow: Chat Input -> Research Agent -> Annual Report Search (fetch 20 -> Cohere rerank to 5) -> cited answer.\n\nNext versions add: input guardrail, output check, error workflow, Langfuse tracing.",
